math","value":"\\mu"},{"type":"text","value":" ，最大静摩擦力等于滑动摩擦力，则顺利发出第一张牌过程中\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/e28eacd15674d943f0d88b8b52c7b6cf8e0d59544d0271ce4eee5d88f1ce0eac.png","width":187,"height":198,"width_mm":21.899,"row_group":"jiaxing-yimo-2512-q06-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第6题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 大拇指与第一张牌之间的摩擦力是滑动摩擦力"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 第一张牌和第二张牌之间的摩擦力为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu (mg + F_{\\mathrm{N}})"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 第二张牌和第三张牌之间的摩擦力为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu (2mg + F_{\\mathrm{N}})"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 越下面的牌受到的压力越大，牌受到的摩擦力也越大"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"B","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--jiaxing-yimo-2512-q07","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--jiaxing-yimo-2512","source_question_id":"jiaxing-yimo-2512-q07","number":"7","order":7,"type":"单选题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"b69849131d6216753d1f8bd6259983119f5d2547f66649e6781a5cc88b6a9ae2","body":[{"type":"text","value":"7. 物理课上，老师做了一个奇妙的“跳环实验”。如图所示，插有铁芯的螺线管直立在水平桌面上，铁芯上套着一个铝环，螺线管与电源、开关相连，线圈上端与电源正极相连，闭合开关的瞬间，铝环立刻向上跳起。下列说法中正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ecedeff94e463a4807c2550a38b8f56b2ced17f1e9374d33ec5e4af52d58b120.png","width":333,"height":228,"width_mm":39.158,"row_group":"jiaxing-yimo-2512-q07-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第7题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 若保持开关闭合，则铝环停留在某一高度"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 跳起的铝环会回落，断开开关时铝环又将跳起"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 若将电源的正、负极对调，观察到的现象不变"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 若换用交流电源做实验，则观察不到铝环跳起的现象"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"C","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--jiaxing-yimo-2512-q08","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--jiaxing-yimo-2512","source_question_id":"jiaxing-yimo-2512-q08","number":"8","order":8,"type":"单选题","topics":["光学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"6fb236545c63ee2502aaddc489e611afab4c25f997e00ccc8306609efb138e11","body":[{"type":"text","value":"8. 光纤通信采用的光导纤维由内芯和外套组成，如图为光纤输入端的截面示意图，一束红光以入射角 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" （可调）从一端轴心处射入，经多次全反射后从光纤另一端射出。已知光纤内芯材料的折射率为 "},{"type":"math","value":"n_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，外套的折射率为 "},{"type":"math","value":"n_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，该段光纤的总长为 L，真空中的光速为 c。则（从折射率 "},{"type":"math","value":"n_{A}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的介质射向折射率 "},{"type":"math","value":"n_{B}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的介质，发生全反射的临界角 C 满足关系 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin C=\\frac{n_{B}}{n_{A}}"},{"type":"text","value":" ）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a1011b99e1606ef51cba19209c96c9286cc6d63081b1892a390fd22a29a1f96a.png","width":522,"height":186,"width_mm":61.383,"row_group":"jiaxing-yimo-2512-q08-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第8题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 光纤外套的折射率比内芯的大"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 当 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin \\theta_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 逐渐增大到 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sqrt{n_{2}^{2}-n_{1}^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时，光束通过光纤时将有能量散失"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 该光束无能量散失地通过这段光纤的最长时间为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{n_{1}^{2}L}{n_{2}c}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 若改用蓝光以相同的入射角 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 射入，蓝光通过光纤的时间较红光短"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"C","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--jiaxing-yimo-2512-q09","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--jiaxing-yimo-2512","source_question_id":"jiaxing-yimo-2512-q09","number":"9","order":9,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"a621e3768a9887f3856aef5215642061dc78879b3ff96c2d9aeabf6c1780ec11","body":[{"type":"text","value":"9. 在某次深空探测活动中，科学家发现两颗恒星 A、B 相对静止绕着共同的圆心 O 在同一平面内做匀速圆周运动，A、B 连线经过 O 点，P 是 A、B 连线与 A 运动轨道的交点，某时刻空间位置如图所示。小禹同学猜想，这个系统中如果还存在一个天体 C，应该也可以实现三个天体都绕着 O 匀速运动。若这是一个 A、B、C 组成的 “三星系统”，则\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a40f0da7e7b98a03617d80f6e56918a11f813722dceb4d230ab68a9739dae82f.png","width":275,"height":249,"width_mm":32.204,"row_group":"jiaxing-yimo-2512-q09-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第9题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"ty