alue":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"I=\\frac u{R_1}=2\\sqrt2\\,\\mathrm A"},{"type":"text","value":"安培力"},{"type":"math","value":"F=B_1IL"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"F=4\\sqrt2\\,\\mathrm N"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"text","value":"②电流表测有效值，根据有效值定义"},{"type":"math","value":"\\left(\\frac I{\\sqrt2}\\right)^2R_1\\frac T2=I_{\\text{有效}}^2R_1T"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"I_{\\text{有效}}=\\sqrt2\\,\\mathrm A"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"text","value":"（2）①沿斜面向上建立坐标系，导轨末端 P、M 为坐标原点，沿斜面向上为正方向。导体棒 a 所受合外力"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{\\text{合力}}=B_1I(L-2x)-mg\\sin\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）化简得："},{"type":"math","value":"F_{\\text{合力}}=-2(x-0.5)"},{"type":"text","value":"，即导体棒以0.5 m处为平衡位置做简谐振动。"},{"type":"text","value":"合外力与位移成线性关系，根据图像面积可以得"},{"type":"math","value":"W_{\\text{合外力}}=\\frac{3}{16}\\,\\mathrm J"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"text","value":"求得到达导轨末端的速度大小"},{"type":"math","value":"v=\\frac{\\sqrt{30}}4\\,\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"text","value":"②设导体棒 a 到达 GE 的速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_0"},{"type":"math","value":"m_1g(l\\sin45^\\circ\\sin30^\\circ+h)=\\frac12m_1v_0^2-\\frac12m_1v^2"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"v_0=3.5\\,\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"假定两导体棒没有相碰，则两者达到共同速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\text{共}}"},{"type":"math","value":"m_1v_0=(m_1+m_2)v_{\\text{共}}"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\text{共}}=1.4\\,\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"text","value":"对导体棒 a 用动量定理"},{"type":"math","value":"-\\frac{B_2^2L^2\\Delta x}{R_1+R_2}=m_1v_{\\text{共}}-m_1v_0"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta x=1.05\\,\\mathrm m>1\\,\\mathrm m"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"text","value":"导体棒 a 与导体棒 b 已经相碰。"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--jiaxing-yimo-2512-q18","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--jiaxing-yimo-2512","source_question_id":"jiaxing-yimo-2512-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["近代物理","电学","光学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"466e22048137337c382403579447939eb696cf711b8614d4e0b716a442854bf1","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. (13 分)自由电子激光器的工作原理简述如下：如图所示，由加速器产生的高能电子束水平射入沿竖直方向排列、极性交替变换的一系列长为 L、宽为 d 的磁极产生的磁场中，电子在磁场的作用下扭摆前进，因电子扭摆而产生电磁辐射。一个电子每扭摆一次（如从图中位置 P 到 Q）就会发出一个光脉冲（即一个光子），位于激光器两端的反射镜使光子来回反射，最终从略为透光的右侧镜面射出激光。已知加速后的电子动能 "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{k}=1.8\\times10^{4}eV"},{"type":"text","value":" ，水平射入磁场时速度与中轴线 "},{"type":"math","value":"OO'"},{"type":"text","value":" 的夹角 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta=45^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，取电子质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m=9.0\\times10^{-31}kg"},{"type":"text","value":" ，电荷量 "},{"type":"math","value":"e=1.6\\times10^{-19}C"},{"type":"text","value":" ，不计电子发出光子后能量的损失，磁极长度均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"L=\\sqrt{2}cm"},{"type":"text","value":" 。若忽略左右磁极间的缝隙，磁极间磁场视为匀强磁场，不考虑相对论效应，则\n（1）为使电子能完成上述扭摆运动，磁极的宽度 d 至少应为多大？极间磁场的磁感应强度应为多大？\n（2）在图示 PQ 间先后激发两个光子的时间间隔是多少？\n（3）若该激光器发出的激光强度 "},{"type":"math","value":"P_{\\text{激光}}=1.989\\times10^{12}"},{"type":"text","value":" W/m "},{"type":"math","value":"^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，激光的频率 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\nu=10^{16}\\,\\mathrm{Hz}"},{"type":"text","value":"，普朗克常量 "},{"type":"math","value":"h=6.63\\times10^{-34}"},{"type":"text","value":" J·s。\n①求该激光器发出的激光束在单位体积内的光子数；\n②用该激光照射金属进行金属镂刻，激光照射时与金属表面垂直，其中 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{3}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的光子被吸收，另外 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{2}{3}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的光子反弹，求金属表面所受的压强值。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/b965f08cd69e9baa5dc267e2c6ea6a8b83a3e2eea7caee4a85170a55789af754.png","width":1011,"height":447,"width_mm":118.886,"row_group":"jiaxing-yimo-2512-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第18题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（1）几何关系可知，粒子的半径"},{"type":"math","value":"R = 1\\mathrm{cm}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）宽度至少应为"},{"type":"math","value":"(2 - \\sqrt{2})"},{"type":"text","value":"cm（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"evB = m\\frac{v^2}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{\\mathrm{k}} = \\frac{1}{2} mv^{2}"},{"type":"math","value":"B = 0.045\\mathrm{T}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"text","value":"（2）带电粒子在磁场中的周期"},{"type":"math","value":"T=\\frac{2\\pi m}{eB}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"text","value":"激发两光子的时间间隔为"},{"type":"math","value":"0.5T=1.25\\pi\\times10^{-10}s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"text","value":"（3）①截面积为 S，长度为 L 的光柱总能量"},{"type":"math","value":"E=P_{\\text{激光}}S t=P_{\\text{激光}}S\\frac{L}{c}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"text","value":"则单位体积内的光子数"},{"type":"math","value":"n = \\frac{N}{V} = \\frac{\\frac{E}{h\\nu}}{SL} = \\frac{P_{\\text{激光}}}{ch\\nu}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"text","value":"代入数据得"},{"type":"math","value":"n = 1 \\times 10^{21}"},{"type":"text","value":"（个）；（1分）"},{"type":"text","value":"②在"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta t"},{"type":"text","value":"内照射到面积为S的金属材料上光子数为"},{"type":"math","value":"N=\\frac{P_{\\text{激光}}S\\Delta t}{h\\nu}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"text","value":"每个光子的动量"},{"type":"math","value":"p = \\frac{h\\nu}{c}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"text","value":"根据动量定理有"},{"type":"math","value":"P_{\\text{压强}}S\\Delta t=\\frac{1}{3}Np+\\frac{2}{3}N\\times2p"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{"type":"math","value":"P_{\\text{压强}}=\\frac{5P_{\\text{激光}}}{3c}=1.1\\times10^{4}Pa"},{"type":"text","value":"。(1分)"}]}}]}
